WEBVTT

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.830
To think that even with 
the power of Batolov,

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.790
we can't even leave a mark.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.840
This is...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:34.340
That's Laetitia's left foot.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.930
Better use it with care,
or I'll beat you senseless.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:48.710
It is a spear befitting the Buranki 
Batolov and the future king, Justin Lion.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.990
I accept the swan's left foot

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:54.070
and will use it gratefully.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.570
Okay, then.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:59.070
Let's go kick that old man Guy's ass!

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.260
In accordance with God's words,

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:15.360
we gave birth, propagated, 
filled this Earth,

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.630
and took dominion over all living things.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:24.280
Yet mankind is foolish,
forever fighting among themselves.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.430
But by the power of this new god,

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:31.190
mankind, as a race of living beings,

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.650
can finally progress to the next stage.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.980
Pain?

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.700
Even in this great body,

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.370
the bites of fleas still cause pain?

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:59.050
Damn, you're tough! You're hard as a rock!

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.930
My hands hurt! I'm thirsty! I'm starving!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.100
Epizo!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.080
Justin!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:11.800
Guy...

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.730
You will be next,

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.820
witch's daughter.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.700
Oh, good! You're awake!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.340
A-chan, are you okay?

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.080
Yeah.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:30.860
Where are we?

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.790
Inside that massive thing's body, apparently.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.940
A-chan, does it still hurt?

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.930
Nah. Thanks, Kogane-chan.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:43.300
I wish the rest of us could take 
some of the pain from you.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.940
Don't be dumb, Kogane.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.390
Like hell I want that.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.990
What? Jeez, talk about self-centered.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:53.890
Of course, they do say guys 
don't handle pain well.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:56.440
Hiiragi, king of pain.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.570
The pain king.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.900
What the heck? Shut up!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.700
What I'm saying is,

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.120
isn't it because Azuma 
takes on the pain for us

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.950
that we're all able to work as one?

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.300
Hii-kun...

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.460
Hiiragi, you say some nice things sometimes!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.390
Sometimes?! What do you mean, sometimes?!

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:18.160
I say nice things all the time!

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:21.080
You just never listen, Kinoa!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.350
Sure, sure.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.770
Thanks, Hiiragi.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.150
Thanks, Kogane-chan...

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:36.650
Kinoa...

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:37.980
Shizuru.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.750
That's right. We are one right now.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.160
Let's go!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.330
To defeat Guy and save Reoko,

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:48.910
with Oubu!

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.270
Right!

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.720
Kazuki Migiwa...

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.230
Our child.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.500
What are you...

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.690
What are you saying, Oubu?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.540
Oubu! Please, answer me!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.430
We, the ones you call "Buranki,"

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.460
are servants of the Great 
One of the beginning

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:46.360
who prepare the planet that it
will reside on for its coming.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:55.190
To escape the fate of the 
Great One's fall as our lord,

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.310
we arrived at this planet 
after a long journey.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.540
But the Great One did not

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:06.570
wish to modify this planet, 
with its overflowing life,

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.990
so they chose to go to sleep.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.280
And so, we wasted away.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:20.590
Over a long period of time, our bodies, 
which decayed on this planet,

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.280
began to mingle with those of humans,

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.390
leading to a deep union.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.540
Eventually, a certain being was born.

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:35.810
A living being that, while human, 
could also be called a Buranki.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.980
Migiwa, that is you.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:45.540
The fact that you bore children,

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.710
but did not pass your powers 
on to them, is the proof.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:50.970
So...

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.040
So that's it.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.440
Azuma! Undo the fusion!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.670
We'll go on ahead and make a path!

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:20.960
So you can go straight to Entei... to Reoko!

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.130
But Hiiragi...

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.850
Azuma! There's no time for arguing!

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:25.740
Kinoa...

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.300
Go, Azuma...

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.070
Our heart.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.610
Shizuru...

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:31.620
A-chan!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.620
It's okay if we split up for now!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.610
Even if we're apart, we share the same mind!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.620
Yeah!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.950
Kogane-chan...

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:47.380
Okay! I'm counting on you all!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.930
Let's go, Tsurarai!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.840
Time to fly, Iwatooshi!

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:58.600
Slice 'em up until nothing's 
left, Himekiri! Hoemaru!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.690
Righty-chan, full-power rocket punch!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.330
Go, Oubu!

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:33.090
Reoko...

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.250
Reoko, you and I are one.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.370
Why? Why isn't anything happening?!

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:02.660
Entei...

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.530
Is it dead, with its brain rotted away?

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:10.880
But that day, back then... 
I'm certain Reoko...

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:15.390
Migiwa, I was merely called to this place

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.950
as an impetus to your awakening.

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:24.970
At that time, your existence 
transitioned to a new appearance.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.990
We are currently within the past time.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:33.150
Your current self has the 
power to travel across time,

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:36.750
as well as even greater powers.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.540
Right now, I feel like maybe 
I can understand that.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.540
Do what you must do,

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.290
our beloved child.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.200
Thank you, Oubu.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:07.420
Reoko, you and I are one.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.330
Have you...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.290
always been there?

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:08.830
You were with me all along, Migiwa.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.470
Reoko!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.990
Reoko!

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:33.990
Reoko?

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.530
Since the day

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.210
that my body's time stopped,

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.690
every moment I've lived 
has been so meaningless.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:48.810
After Migiwa was so kind 
as to give me this life...

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:54.460
In return for not dying, I never even lived.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.440
Reoko...

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:01.340
I don't think living is ever meaningless.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.490
You're alive right now.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:10.060
Just that, just the fact that you're alive,
makes me really happy.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.010
Let's go, Reoko.

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:21.360
Honestly...

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:24.250
You're always all banged up.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.620
Am I?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:26.990
You are.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:30.370
Thank you, Azuma.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:32.500
Sure.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:37.740
Lend me your strength so we can stop Guy,

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.440
Kazuki Azuma.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.640
Yes. Of course, Reoko.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.140
Ow...

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.320
Righty-chan, hang in there!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:53.810
Did Azuma actually make it to Entei?

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.110
Nyo nyo?

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.360
What is that?

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.330
What are these flames?! They're not hot!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.240
What is this Buranki?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.130
Oubu? No, it's not.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.140
It's not Entei, either.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:13.980
Entei-Oubu...

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.500
That's no different!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.170
Let's go, Reoko!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.960
Right! Let's go together, Azuma!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.150
I guess I have no choice but to do it!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.180
What now?!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:42.690
What is that?

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:47.770
Kaoruko, here.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.750
Huh? Okay.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.810
What is that Buranki?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:01.570
Have Entei and Oubu fused together?

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.600
Regardless of what type of Buranki it is,

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.810
it's no match for me!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.740
So that's the power of Reoko and Azuma...

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.080
...fused together into Entei-Oubu?

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.200
It's over, Guy!

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:40.710
We won't let you have your way anymore!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.930
You damned devil,
who would sacrifice all those

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:48.340
young Bubuki users for the 
sake of your own ambitions...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.720
I'm going to put an end to you!

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.830
Banryuu Reoko...

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.730
If Entei is here, then...

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.850
How dare you...

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.700
How dare you, Banryuu Reoko?!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.330
You won't get away with this!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.840
Azuma! Reoko!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:31.350
I'm going to have you and Entei attach 
the god's head to its body again, Reoko!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.740
Reoko!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.920
Damn you...

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.570
Damn you!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.590
What is that light?

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:20.570
But since they've come back here, 
I have a chance of winning.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.750
Why are you getting in my way?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.170
I'm going to rebuild this world,

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:32.880
tainted by the intermingling of 
humans and Buranki, from zero!

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:36.200
Mankind will begin its bloody history

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:41.210
once more before me, its god!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:46.090
Nonsense! Your hands are just 
as bloody themselves, Guy!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:51.270
Guy, I don't understand what you're saying.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.710
Reoko and I did nothing but 
fight each other for so long.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.090
We think completely differently.

00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:02.530
But now we're piloting Entei-Oubu together.

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:06.740
I'm really happy to have Reoko with me.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:08.890
So I know that you,

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:14.700
someone who only tries to make this world 
look the way you want it, are wrong!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:19.330
We are not cursed,
and we're not tainted, either!

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.900
An ignorant child like you 
dares to boast to me?!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:30.310
I will... I will eliminate 
the two of you right here!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:42.810
What will you do to me, the brain 
of the god Deus Magna, little boy?

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:47.310
<i>Will you break that heart 
and enter the brain?</i>

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.440
Azuma...

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.280
You are right.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:55.910
We must not listen to a fool 
who has forgotten how to

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.200
doubt his own sense of justice.

00:16:58.690 --> 00:16:59.790
Reoko...

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:00.830
Yeah!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:08.950
Impossible!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.850
I am inside its brain...

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.760
I am its brain! How are 
they pushing me back?!

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.220
Two hearts?

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.920
Reoko?

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.940
Azuma, you mustn't dirty your hands.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.030
Reoko...

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.360
Hear me, witch's son.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:22.410
Kazuki Azuma, you are no 
longer an ordinary human.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:27.530
Now that you have used the Buranki's 
power to suit your will,

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:31.520
once this battle is over, you will 
have to return to the human world...

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:37.550
To the boring life of doing the 
same mundane things day after day.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.560
When you do that,

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:44.420
do you think you'll be able 
to consider the life of the

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.390
stinking drunk stumbling 
down the street valuable?!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:51.270
Of course you can't! Just like me!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:19:00.650
Your mind has already been taken 
over by the Buranki, Kazuki Azuma!

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.680
What happened to Azuma? And Reoko?

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.380
Are they okay?!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.900
I don't know.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.500
This is...

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:47.290
Entei? What is the matter?

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.660
<i>Reoko, I'm going.</i>

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:53.630
Migiwa? Your consciousness...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.390
<i>Listen to me, Reoko.</i>

00:19:56.890 --> 00:20:00.240
<i>This comet came here for me...</i>

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.380
<i>To hold together the lives of the 
gentle giants of the galaxy,</i>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.640
<i>scattered among the stars.</i>

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.010
But that's...

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:12.870
Migiwa, I never noticed.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.270
You were right beside me all along.

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.790
<i>Please don't worry about that, Reoko.</i>

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:25.290
<i>After melding with Entei, I had 
forgotten just what I was.</i>

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:29.540
<i>But I'm so glad I was able to 
protect you up until today.</i>

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:34.670
<i>It's the least I can do to atone 
for the mistake I made back then.</i>

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.330
What are you saying?

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:39.420
All this time, that's exactly why I...

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:59.000
<i>Reoko, take care of Azuma and Kaoruko.</i>

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.580
Ugh, damn it!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.950
Just sitting around waiting 
really pisses me off!

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.780
Did Azuma and Reoko beat 
Guy or didn't they?!

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.460
Are they alive or dead?!

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:54.790
A-chan's...

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:56.710
A-chan's voice...

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.290
I can hear A-chan's voice calling!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.550
Hey! Kogane!

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:04.430
Jeez, she has no patience.

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:05.910
Well, guess I'll go, too!

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:07.890
Ba-zoom!

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:10.080
Sheesh.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:15.430
Hey! Wait a second, you guys!

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:20.220
Oh, damn it!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:46.970
<b>Episode 23
The Gentle Giants
of the Galaxy</b>

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:46.970
<b><i>The Gentle Giants
of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.020
<b><i>BUBUKI BURANKI</i></b>

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.020
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.580
<b>To Be Continued</b>
